  "notes": "Warm paper-tone background (#f4f2ec) with a dark navy sidebar gives a civic/newsprint feel. Status is colour-coded consistently: red Missed, amber At risk, purple dashed 'Unconfirmed' (? date chips with dashed border), blue Awaiting affidavit, green On track; table rows carry a coloured left rule for missed/at-risk. Urgent cards have a 3px coloured top border, a grey 'MUST RUN BY' strip with days-left in status colour, and a dashed amber 'Earliest edition' box with a mono countdown. Insertion dates render as small mono chips (✓ confirmed green, ? unconfirmed dashed purple, × struck-through red). Header has a persistent amber 'Next legal cutoff' countdown pill. Live: status tabs filter the table; clicking a row opens a right slide-in detail drawer with a deadline-window timeline, insertion list, proof toggles, owner select and history; the bell navigates to a 'Paper messages' inbox-style master–detail page. Avatars with initials mark owners; no codebook entry for avatar/owner display."
